{"articleNo":"43464","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=43464&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012 캠퍼스특허전략유니버시아드 설명회","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.03.15","hit":"4794","attachments":[{"name":"포스터.jpg","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=43464&attachNo=70399"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><u>2012년 캠퍼스특허전략유니버시아드 대회지원 설명회</u></span></span></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">재학생들의 특허역량강화와 대회 우수 입상을 위하여 아래와 같이&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">대회지원 설명회를 개최하오니&nbsp;많은 참여바랍니다. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ○ 일시 : 2012. 3. 22(목) 13:00</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ○ 장소 : 디지털관 시청각실 127호</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 참석대상 : 대학(원)생 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ○ 설명회 내용</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 대회일정 및 특징 : 한국발명진흥회 (대회주관기관)&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;대회입상전략 및 요령 소개(산학협력단 특허담당)&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ＊교육일정</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ＊전년도 수상작(선행, 특허전략 답안보고서) 등&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ○ 2011 입상현황&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 선행조사부문 5명 (전국 5위)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 특허전략부문 2팀 (전국 16위)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 문의 : 산학협력단 (교내 7232)&nbsp; </span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
